    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49091" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρεπ-τικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>able to feed</i> or <i>rear</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινος</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Plt.</u>
				267b
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				276b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				276c
			</span></i>; <i>nourishing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτερα μῆλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.Siph.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				3.82f
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ώτατος οἶνος</span>
				Mnesith.ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.32d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>of</i> or <i>promoting growth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ δύναμις τῆς ψυχῆς θ. καὶ γεννητική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					416a19
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ θ. ψυχή</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				415a23
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θ</span>. <i>the principle of
				growth</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1102b11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ θ. καὶ αὐξητικὴ ζωή</span>
			ib. <i><span class="en">
				1098a1
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φθαρτικός</span>,
				Polystr.<i><span class="en">
				p.23
			</span></i> W. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Gaur.</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>causing to heal up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλκῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.43
				</span></i>
			.</div>
